#: scenario5:scenario5_8F06FDAA_D70F_4B25_9CB1_91BFBD550E52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ec32faa77c073cd0575338d92da8bba2d52df9f1a7d9190e48aecc3e80b920b
