#: scenario5:scenario5_286B7D41_1DBD_4963_8BB6_40E7871B4AEC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 766529f3db4f4b8b1742d0ad27fdf5cdf92d8be28de5de9415e4b3c968334d9d
#. default-sha256: cd47aa35625f2c93e58f46be51b99b24585e394f6fb16d76a2db8f774c412b17
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_286B7D41_1DBD_4963_8BB6_40E7871B4AEC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Last year, I requested flower seeds.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But I just couldn’t get them to grow,⟪k:3⟫and "
"I was starting to think they never would..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’anno scorso avevo richiesto dei semi di fiori.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ma non riuscivo a farli crescere, "
"e avevo iniziato a pensare che non sarebbero mai germogliati..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_3302F5D2_B114_4275_97BE_2F2149B8F654
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6d0f6bbfb8835f08e8da1e047d6f9cafd7bfb1b53d103ab4fd9ba8fd0b6d0c9
