msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Che cosa? ⟪k:1⟫Perché?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_93B6E9D6_C9ED_40CF_A240_4EF6D799D9D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f148d63c9b2aae2d35d4681802f7c7432f9500e46ebb0bef1fd73b3f79677776
#. default-sha256: 4de01aa3931f08adea4f8f19027a8b56ed773f94ebb32e4ad643a6478fca28f9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_93B6E9D6_C9ED_40CF_A240_4EF6D799D9D9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Roses make wonderful gifts, supposedly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sai, le rose sono dei doni meravigliosi."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B595E7DD_16E6_4193_8F62_1AA39B0F2F5E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1cde5954f05cc812274c212d7565e91e01145b3a55c281ab29fec0b62be01a6
#. default-sha256: dbf9788efbb534bb9fc21c78a0727860d919b92941cc311d0d883ba8ef73a75e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B595E7DD_16E6_4193_8F62_1AA39B0F2F5E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No... ⟪k:1⟫that’s not what I meant. ⟪k:2⟫Why ⟪k:3⟫me⟪k:4⟫?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I haven’t given you "
"anything..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No... ⟪k:1⟫non è questo che intendevo. ⟪k:2⟫Perché ⟪k:3⟫a me⟪k:4⟫?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Io non ti ho "
"dato nulla..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_98B059F8_2C14_45D6_A5F8_BA68EBCD10C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbff812bc335d9078bf40e5952e41077612680795f7a883803439d6689445f4a
#. default-sha256: 6fecf248d19d02b2dc2337c4dc5f664b9d751046bd69ad066aa7919079cf7d3a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_98B059F8_2C14_45D6_A5F8_BA68EBCD10C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Consider it... ⟪k:1⟫a symbol of my hope that we’ll still be this close another year from "
"now. ⟪k:2⟫If we are, then this is yours."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Considerala... ⟪k:1⟫come il simbolo della mia speranza—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫la speranza di restare "
"così vicini per un altro anno.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Se lo saremo, allora questa è tua."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1BCBC943_BC9D_4727_AB28_372BA1BDAF2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0f721a89079788ab59ec9cd5f8dcf43ffc6891a1389cc6d06eada7fc02b9597
#. default-sha256: b1afa24a1d7b6c08db87fadb77560e38366c570c717267777239d083d40bdf28
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1BCBC943_BC9D_4727_AB28_372BA1BDAF2C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I don’t follow her reasoning...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Non riesco a seguire il suo ragionamento...)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_CA332F6C_B6C2_4A94_9397_F3CA7D5603B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c35dae0a79b234b3de5e40da94c8ae83732589a72d858a5d1749cddcca34827c
#. default-sha256: 8c22c0734ba5fc96a4ff10d90edf23be292aa7f5a9e28ed160ba70df6081bd1d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CA332F6C_B6C2_4A94_9397_F3CA7D5603B7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I don’t follow it at all, but...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Non lo capisco affatto, ma...)"

#: scenario5:scenario5_17F7FE40_5B12_4BF2_82C0_C67C4A5EAD5C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2678e6b43594a7a5e2239ae8bcf358166962d2f3f113a4dd373f1b39425eee3b
#. default-sha256: ae6a4583af0bd8f314397271078dc1c996a9b5c99dd0ec43628e17f0aa6494a0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_17F7FE40_5B12_4BF2_82C0_C67C4A5EAD5C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...The sight of the deep red rose almost melting into the dark night was perhaps the most "
"wondrous thing I had ever seen in my life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...La vista di quella rosa rossa che quasi si fondeva col buio della notte era probabilmente "
"la cosa più bella che avessi mai visto."

#: scenario5:scenario5_12F92596_4849_4E96_BC08_4A9985D500EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
